    "Phrases that make the listing form refuse a submission.",
    "Built from IHREC v Daft (WRC 2019) and the ten protected grounds under the Equal Status Acts.",
    "Matching rules: lowercase the input, collapse all whitespace to single spaces, strip punctuation, then check each phrase as a substring on word boundaries.",
    "Every hit is logged to blocklist_hits with the category so the list can be extended from real attempts.",
    "The form must tell the host which phrase tripped and why. Never a silent reject.",
    "Structured fields (schedule, meals, room type, lifestyle rules) carry the facts. Free text is for describing the house, not the lodger.",
